INSTRUCTOR-PUBLISHING.md

# IDE and operating-system state
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Unity exports, captures, and packaged course material are not this submission.
